  "scope": "Let G=K_{3,3} on the labelled parts P={p1,p2,p3} and Q={q1,q2,q3}. Let R(G) have as vertices all labelled maximal compatible tubings under exactly the tube and compatibility definitions frozen in source.md and problem.md, retaining the common full tube and taking no quotient by automorphisms; join two vertices exactly when one non-full tube is exchanged. Then diam R(K_{3,3})=12.",
